  "historyUrl": "https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/Halloween_Hat?action=history",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/c/c5/Halloween_Hat.png/revision/latest?cb=20241021192419\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Halloween Hat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Halloween Hat\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/c/c5/Halloween_Hat.png/revision/latest?cb=20241021192419\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Halloween Hat</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Halloween Hat is a type of <a href=\"/wiki/currencies-2658\" title=\"Currencies\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">currency</a> used to buy special prizes from the <a href=\"/wiki/catalogue-8567\" title=\"Catalogue\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">catalogue</a>. It's part of the Halloween event.\n</p><p>It is unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 17.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Getting hallowen hat</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/d/d8/Riverboat.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20130128022343\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Riverboat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Riverboat\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/d/d8/Riverboat.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/150?cb=20130128022343\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"104\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Riverboat</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Each boat during the event requires one type of <a href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-halloween-treats-maker-products-36166\" title=\"Category:Halloween Treats Maker Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">treats</a> from the <a href=\"/wiki/halloween-treats-maker-36156\" title=\"Halloween Treats Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">halloween treats maker</a>. Filling any box with a treat gives you a certain amount of halloween hats.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Using hallowen hat</b></span></h3>\n<p><i>Main article: <a href=\"/wiki/catalogue-8567\" title=\"Catalogue\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Catalogue</a></i>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/4/4c/Catalogue_Front_With_Halloween_Hat.png/revision/latest?cb=20241021192430\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"The catalogue\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"The catalogue\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/4/4c/Catalogue_Front_With_Halloween_Hat.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/150?cb=20241021192430\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"201\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>The catalogue</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Halloween Hat can be used to purchase items from the \"Fyne &amp; Mysterious Gifts <a href=\"/wiki/catalogue-8567\" title=\"Catalogue\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Catalogue</a>,\" found by clicking the blue post box at the end of the driveway. Different gifts have different prices.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260901030946\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.020 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.027 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 761/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 333/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 51/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/200\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   11.188      1 -total\n 45.04%    5.039      1 Template:Navigation\n 15.45%    1.728      1 Template:Languages\n 13.57%    1.518      1 Template:PageDisplay\n 11.27%    1.261      3 Template:Clr\n 10.90%    1.220      1 Template:Main\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_hayday:pcache:idhash:36167-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260901030946 and revision id 106004. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
